<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Password Changed Successfully</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #1e40af;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .header-title {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        .success-icon {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 48px;
            margin: 0 0 20px 0;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #0f172a;
            margin: 0 0 20px 0;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .paragraph {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #0f172a;
            margin: 16px 0;
        }
        .success-card {
            background-color: #dcfce7;
            border: 1px solid #86efac;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .success-title {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #166534;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 0 0 12px 0;
        }
        .success-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #14532d;
            margin: 8px 0;
        }
        .info-card {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .info-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #64748b;
            margin: 8px 0;
        }
        .warning-card {
            background-color: #fef3c7;
            border: 1px solid #fbbf24;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .warning-title {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #92400e;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 0 0 12px 0;
        }
        .warning-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #78350f;
            margin: 8px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .footer-text {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #64748b;
            margin: 8px 0;
        }
        .footer-link {
            color: #1e40af;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) {
            .content {
                padding: 20px 16px;
            }
            .greeting {
                font-size: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1 class="header-title">Equipment Rental Platform</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <div class="success-icon">✅</div>
            
            <h2 class="greeting">Hello {{fullName}},</h2>
            
            <p class="paragraph">
                Your password has been successfully changed. This email confirms the security update to your account.
            </p>
            
            <div class="success-card">
                <p class="success-title">Password Changed</p>
                <p class="success-text">
                    <strong>Changed at:</strong> {{passwordChangedAt}}
                </p>
                <p class="success-text">
                    All active sessions on other devices have been logged out for your security.
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="info-card">
                <p class="info-text">
                    You can now log in to your account using your new password on all devices.
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="warning-card">
                <p class="warning-title">⚠️ Didn't make this change?</p>
                <p class="warning-text">
                    If you did not request or make this password change, please contact our support team immediately at <a href="mailto:support@rentalplatform.com" style="color: #92400e; font-weight: bold;">support@rentalplatform.com</a>
                </p>
                <p class="warning-text">
                    Your account security may be compromised. Our team will help you secure your account right away.
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <p class="paragraph">
                <strong>Security tips:</strong>
            </p>
            <ul style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6;">
                <li>Use a strong, unique password for your account</li>
                <li>Never share your password with anyone</li>
                <li>Enable two-factor authentication if available</li>
                <li>Log out of devices you no longer use</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p class="footer-text">
                Need help? Contact our support team at <a href="mailto:support@rentalplatform.com" class="footer-link">support@rentalplatform.com</a>
            </p>
            <p class="footer-text">
                &copy; {{currentYear}} Equipment Rental Platform. All rights reserved.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
